<h2>Can the app explain a 3 AM wake-up?</h2>
<p><strong>No.</strong> A wake-up time and a wearable score can't show what caused it.</p>
<p>Cortisol+ does not diagnose insomnia, sleep apnea, perimenopause or a cortisol disorder.</p>
<p>If sleep problems keep going or affect your daily life, talk to a healthcare professional. Don't rely on the app to choose a treatment.</p>

<ZenPicture src="/app-ui/zen/zen-doctor.webp" caption="The app shows your nights. A doctor helps with the why." />

<h2>Does a sleep score replace a cortisol test?</h2>
<p><strong>No.</strong> Medical cortisol tests use blood, urine or saliva. The result is read in light of when and why the test was done.</p>
<p><a href="https://medlineplus.gov/lab-tests/cortisol-test/">MedlinePlus explains cortisol tests</a>.</p>
<p>The Cortisol+ score is a separate wellness reading of your wearable data.</p>
<p>See <a href="/features/hrv-stress-monitoring/">HRV stress monitoring</a>, our <a href="/stress/apple-watch/">Apple Watch stress guide</a>, and <a href="/download/">download and subscription information</a> before deciding whether the app fits your needs.</p>
